{
  "dom_id": "step-t5696",
  "name": "Inverse Square Laws",
  "problem": "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14187741/assets/a2bbedb8a024b6cd75c333e2c0cf025558b71eafeb7215d9c7dbf2fbd678230a.png)\n\nIt is known that the gravitational force $F,$ measured in newtons, that the earth exerts on the moon varies inversely with the **square** of the distance $r,$ in kilometers, between their centers.\n\nAccording to this information, the equation that relates $F$ and $r$ is\n\n$$\nF = \\dfrac{k}{r^2},\n$$\n\nwhere $k$ is a constant of variation. This type of relationship is called an **inverse square law**.\n\nAs it turns out, many important physical laws take the form of an inverse square law. Let's see another example.",
  "worked_solution": "",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
  "problem_field_keys": [],
  "answer_fields_complete": null,
  "result": null,
  "proof_feedback": null,
  "html": "<div id=\"step-t5696\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block;\">\n    \n               \n                <div class=\"tutorial\">\n                    <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                        <div class=\"stepName\"><span class=\"stepType\">Inverse Square Laws</span></div>       \n                        <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"t5696\">?</div>\n                    </div>                    \n    \n                    <style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                            float: none;\n                            direction: ltr;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage * {\n                            transition: none;\n                            -webkit-transition: none;